+  // tso-arm: host stack pointer of the dispatcher loop that runs now (the outer one, or the one of a callback from
+  // host code into guest code). A signal handler that sends the thread back to the loop top from inside a block
+  // leaves the block's spill area on the stack; the loop top resets the stack pointer to this value.
